{"version":"1.2.0","category":"26_security_privacy_governance","entries":[{"expression":"鍵をかける","interpretation":"Data・機能・経路へのAccessを制限する","context":["Access","Data","機能"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Access制御","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"鍵を分ける","interpretation":"用途・環境・権限ごとにCredentialを分離する","context":["Credential","環境","権限"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"秘密分離","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"鍵を回す","interpretation":"Credentialを定期・緊急に更新して旧鍵を失効する","context":["Credential","秘密","失効"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"秘密更新","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"入口を閉じる","interpretation":"外部からのAccessやRequest受付を停止する","context":["Access","Request","公開"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"封鎖","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"入口を開ける","interpretation":"制御下でAccessやRequest受付を開始する","context":["Access","Request","公開"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"開放","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"権限を絞る","interpretation":"必要最小限の操作・Data範囲へPermissionを制限する","context":["権限","操作","Data"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"最小権限","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"権限を広げる","interpretation":"追加作業に必要なPermissionを付与する","context":["権限","Permission","作業"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"権限付与","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"秘密を伏せる","interpretation":"表示・Log・出力から機密情報を隠す","context":["秘密","Log","表示"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"秘密保護","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"秘密を漏らす","interpretation":"機密情報を許可されない相手や場所へ露出させる","context":["秘密","機密","外部"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"秘密漏えい","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"足跡を残す","interpretation":"操作・判断・Accessの監査記録を保存する","context":["操作","監査","Access"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"監査記録","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"監査の目を入れる","interpretation":"独立確認や監査処理をWorkflowへ追加する","context":["監査","確認","Workflow"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"監査","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"防御の盾を置く","interpretation":"攻撃・誤操作・障害から守るControlを配置する","context":["攻撃","誤操作","防御"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"防御","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"境界に壁を立てる","interpretation":"Network・権限・Dataの境界を分離して越境を制限する","context":["Network","権限","Data"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"境界防御","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"壁を越える","interpretation":"Access制御やNetwork境界を通過する","context":["Access","Network","境界"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"越境","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"門を閉じる","interpretation":"特定条件の利用者・Request・処理を拒否する","context":["利用者","Request","条件"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Access拒否","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"門を開く","interpretation":"承認済み条件で利用・Accessを許可する","context":["利用","Access","承認"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Access許可","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"監査経路を残す","interpretation":"後から追跡できるEvidence・Log・Hashを維持する","context":["Evidence","Log","Hash"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"追跡可能性","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"個人情報を切り離す","interpretation":"処理本体から個人を特定できるDataを分離する","context":["個人情報","Data","処理"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Privacy","version":"1.2.0"}]}